<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech 13-wk T-bills yield 16.10 pct, demand heavy.</title>
<headline>Czech 13-wk T-bills yield 16.10 pct, demand heavy.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in a Czech National Bank auction offering five billion crowns in 13-week finance ministry treasury bills was 16.10 percent, and the auction was heavily oversubscribed with bids totalling 10.02 billion crowns, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said a total of 54.5 percent of bids at the accepted level were taken.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
